@startuml
actor User
boundary "views/memos/show.html.erb" as View
control "MemosController" as Controller
entity "Memo Model" as Model
database "Database" as DB

User -> View: Request to view memo
View -> Controller: Send GET /memos/:id request
Controller -> Model: Find memo by ID
Model -> DB: Query memo by ID
DB --> Model: Return memo object
Model --> Controller: Pass memo object
Controller -> View: Render memo show page
View -> User: Display memo details
@enduml
